WEBVTT

﻿1

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.594
The authorities in Russia
are bracing themselves today


00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.996
for mass protests against the trial


00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:00.231
of former billionaire Yuri Komarov.


00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:01.736
The case against Mr. Komarov


00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:05.069
has caused widespread division
amongst the Russian public,


00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:08.542
some of whom view
his incarceration as a political maneuver


00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:11.113
orchestrated by this man,


00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:13.649
defense minister candidate Viktor Chagarin.


00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.523
What do you want Viktor?


00:01:34.694 --> 00:01:36.401
Why are you doing this?


00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:39.739
What do you want to accomplish tomorrow?


00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:43.975
I'm prepared to pay for my sins.


00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:50.286
You should prepare yourself too.


00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:52.615
Yuri,


00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:58.556
let's be civil about this. We were friends once...


00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:01.429
...we could be again.


00:02:03.323 --> 00:02:04.893
Just give me the file...


00:02:06.092 --> 00:02:09.972
...and I'll hand your life back to you.


00:02:12.332 --> 00:02:15.108
Forget this stupid trial.


00:02:17.604 --> 00:02:19.345
I don't want my life back.


00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:32.856
You think I'm going to let you talk tomorrow?


00:02:35.388 --> 00:02:37.595
No one is going to hear you!


00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:41.264
I own everybody in that courtroom.


00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:44.535
You don't own me.


00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:58.350
Mike.


00:02:59.379 --> 00:03:01.723
Chagarin's making a move on Komarov.


00:03:02.348 --> 00:03:04.055
- Shit.
- I'll see if we got local.


00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:14.621
We are ready to get started.


00:04:15.188 --> 00:04:16.258
Make the call.


00:04:22.228 --> 00:04:24.708
You won't disappoint me?


00:04:30.403 --> 00:04:32.576
Have I ever disappointed you?


00:04:37.977 --> 00:04:38.717
Anton.


00:04:41.247 --> 00:04:43.249
Alik, it's Viktor.


00:04:43.716 --> 00:04:46.322
Yuri Komarov says hello...


00:04:47.387 --> 00:04:48.593
It's time to grab him.


00:04:49.622 --> 00:04:50.464
Yuri Komarov?


00:04:52.158 --> 00:04:53.159
...and GOODBYE.


00:05:17.317 --> 00:05:19.126
McClane.


00:05:20.953 --> 00:05:22.796
Hey, Murph, how you doing?


00:05:22.955 --> 00:05:25.060
Nice grouping, Grandpa.


00:05:26.459 --> 00:05:29.099
Yeah, not bad.


00:05:30.963 --> 00:05:33.000
Is that it?


00:05:33.833 --> 00:05:36.609
Yep. We found him.


00:05:37.236 --> 00:05:39.409
It's not good, John.


00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.742
Hospital or morgue?


00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.648
Worse.


00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:50.124
When was the last time
you spoke to this kid?


00:05:51.718 --> 00:05:53.459
It's been a while.


00:05:54.921 --> 00:05:57.162
Maybe a few years, even.


00:05:59.092 --> 00:06:02.335
Last time I saw him, it was pretty ugly.


00:06:04.997 --> 00:06:07.409
Well, there's
a few different versions in there,


00:06:07.567 --> 00:06:12.277
but my people are pretty sure
he's being held at a Moscow prison


00:06:12.438 --> 00:06:14.782
awaiting sentencing.


00:06:14.941 --> 00:06:16.750
What's he charged with?


00:06:16.909 --> 00:06:18.115
It's a nasty sheet.


00:06:20.747 --> 00:06:23.318
He'll be lucky to get life.


00:06:26.919 --> 00:06:29.661
He can never get out of his own way.


00:06:31.224 --> 00:06:33.431
He had a lot of problems.


00:06:35.828 --> 00:06:37.830
He's still my kid.


00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:40.939
I know.


00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:45.480
But it's Russia.
They do things differently over there.


00:06:48.141 --> 00:06:49.643
Me, too.


00:06:52.678 --> 00:06:53.816
Good luck, Poppy.


00:06:53.913 --> 00:06:54.914
Thanks, kid.


00:06:56.682 --> 00:06:59.663
Welcome
to John F. Kennedy lnternational Airport.


00:06:59.819 --> 00:07:02.129
Dad, I wish you
would let me go with you.


00:07:02.288 --> 00:07:03.494
You would never be able to resist


00:07:03.556 --> 00:07:05.160
the urge to tell me what to do all the time.


00:07:10.296 --> 00:07:13.300
This isn't your fault. You know?


00:07:13.566 --> 00:07:15.011
I just


00:07:17.136 --> 00:07:20.140
hoped that he'd figured his life out.


00:07:23.743 --> 00:07:24.744
I got you something.


00:07:30.249 --> 00:07:32.126
"Idiot's Travel Guide."


00:07:32.285 --> 00:07:33.355
Perfect.


00:07:35.254 --> 00:07:37.165
Thank you, baby.


00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:39.101
I love you.


00:07:39.258 --> 00:07:40.794
I love you, too.


00:07:41.928 --> 00:07:43.805
See you soon.


00:07:44.363 --> 00:07:45.637
Dad?


00:07:47.099 --> 00:07:49.010
Just try,


00:07:49.168 --> 00:07:53.344
try not to make
an even bigger mess of things.


00:07:56.042 --> 00:07:57.282
Good luck.


00:07:58.644 --> 00:08:01.716
I love you. See you soon.


00:09:11.651 --> 00:09:14.393
I was told you had something to offer me?


00:09:17.523 --> 00:09:20.003
You're looking for evidence against Yuri Komarov?


00:09:23.462 --> 00:09:24.805
Perhaps.


00:09:29.402 --> 00:09:31.575
Put me in the courtroom with him...


00:09:32.238 --> 00:09:35.276
...and I'll testify that Komarov hired me to murder Anton.


00:09:35.575 --> 00:09:36.679
Did he?


00:09:37.777 --> 00:09:39.450
I'll testify under oath.


00:09:41.347 --> 00:09:43.349
That's good enough, isn't it?


00:10:27.093 --> 00:10:29.004
...Draganskiy courthouse?


00:10:29.161 --> 00:10:30.606
You speak Russian?


00:10:31.764 --> 00:10:33.437
How did I do?


00:10:33.599 --> 00:10:37.046
Well, you asked for a large bag of hair


00:10:37.203 --> 00:10:39.683
on the way to Taganskaya courthouse.


00:10:40.706 --> 00:10:43.118
But I got it. I got it.


00:10:43.275 --> 00:10:44.686
Good.


00:10:46.112 --> 00:10:47.887
Traffic sucks here, too, huh?


00:10:47.947 --> 00:10:48.982
Sex?


00:10:50.049 --> 00:10:52.154
You want sex? Sexy clubs?


00:10:52.351 --> 00:10:54.331
No. No sex.


00:10:54.687 --> 00:10:56.325
It sucks, this traffic.


00:10:56.889 --> 00:10:58.300
What is it? An accident?


00:10:58.491 --> 00:10:59.993
No.


00:11:00.326 --> 00:11:02.203
Garden Ring. Is bad.


00:11:02.361 --> 00:11:06.002
Always traffic, always traffic.


00:11:07.333 --> 00:11:08.971
You're American?


00:11:09.135 --> 00:11:13.015
Yeah, American. New York.


00:11:14.473 --> 00:11:16.180
The Big Apple.


00:11:18.344 --> 00:11:23.020
l want to wake up
in that city that never sleeps


00:11:23.082 --> 00:11:25.323
That's it.


00:11:25.484 --> 00:11:27.760
Frank Sinatra. Chairman of the Board.


00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:29.194
That's right.


00:11:29.355 --> 00:11:31.926
The Chairman. Yeah.


00:11:32.091 --> 00:11:34.867
You sing good.


00:11:35.061 --> 00:11:40.033
These little town
blues are melting away


00:11:40.099 --> 00:11:41.510
Yes, I sing.


00:11:41.667 --> 00:11:43.442
I sing all the time.


00:11:43.602 --> 00:11:44.774
Yeah.


00:11:45.237 --> 00:11:48.081
King of the hill
Top of the world


00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.175
Huh?


00:11:49.241 --> 00:11:51.847
Heap. "Top of the heap."


00:11:52.845 --> 00:11:56.850
All right, all right.
Taganskaya courthouse, right there.


00:11:57.016 --> 00:11:58.051
Two blocks.


00:11:58.217 --> 00:12:02.063
You better walk, traffic is bad. Really bad.


00:12:02.221 --> 00:12:03.256
What do I owe you?


00:12:03.355 --> 00:12:04.390
Hey, no money.


00:12:04.557 --> 00:12:08.198
No money, you let me sing. You let me sing.


00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:10.704
You listen to my singing. No money.


00:12:10.863 --> 00:12:12.638
Welcome to Moscow.


00:12:13.165 --> 00:12:17.545
That little
town blues are melting away


00:12:20.106 --> 00:12:24.077
I'm gonna
make a brand new start of it


00:12:25.144 --> 00:12:26.418
In old New York


00:12:49.969 --> 00:12:51.812
...protests
in central Moscow,


00:12:51.937 --> 00:12:53.780
following a day of demonstrations in Russia.


00:12:53.939 --> 00:12:56.078
...face charges publically for the first time.


00:12:56.242 --> 00:12:57.744
Security is tight, as there have been


00:12:57.877 --> 00:12:59.413
several attempts on Komarov's life


00:12:59.578 --> 00:13:00.648
since he's been in prison.


00:14:05.144 --> 00:14:05.986
Quiet!


00:14:06.378 --> 00:14:08.380
Order in the courtroom!


00:14:13.652 --> 00:14:15.689
Order in the courtroom!


00:14:16.422 --> 00:14:17.526
Order!


00:14:20.059 --> 00:14:21.197
Seal the doors!


00:15:54.887 --> 00:15:55.922
Detonator.


00:15:58.624 --> 00:16:00.797
But, sir.. . the drivers?


00:16:03.662 --> 00:16:05.437
Detonator.


00:16:15.574 --> 00:16:17.019
It's gonna be loud.


00:16:42.234 --> 00:16:43.235
Hey!


00:16:59.952 --> 00:17:00.555
Quick!


00:17:04.556 --> 00:17:05.364
Come on, come on!


00:17:05.991 --> 00:17:06.628
Come on now!


00:17:09.328 --> 00:17:10.204
Come, come.


00:17:10.496 --> 00:17:11.133
Come!


00:17:22.307 --> 00:17:22.842
The cage.


00:17:23.142 --> 00:17:24.143
Check the cage.


00:18:10.889 --> 00:18:11.731
They are not here.


00:18:13.192 --> 00:18:14.227
No kidding.


00:18:23.435 --> 00:18:24.038
What's happening?


00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:29.714
Take Komarov alive...


00:18:30.109 --> 00:18:30.883
...kill the other one.


00:18:31.009 --> 00:18:31.419
Yes.


00:18:31.477 --> 00:18:31.887
Alik.


00:18:32.377 --> 00:18:33.788
We need this file.


00:18:41.887 --> 00:18:43.195
Put that on!


00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:45.191
Who are you?


00:18:46.325 --> 00:18:47.360
Your best friend.


00:18:52.297 --> 00:18:53.401
Jack!


00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:55.906
Dad?


00:19:01.807 --> 00:19:03.718
Get out of the van!


00:19:07.079 --> 00:19:08.217
What are you doing here?


00:19:08.380 --> 00:19:09.723
Jack! Hey!


00:19:12.451 --> 00:19:13.452
Jack!


00:19:17.289 --> 00:19:18.290
Shit.


00:19:20.492 --> 00:19:21.562
Komarov! Komarov!


00:19:21.793 --> 00:19:22.430
Quick. .. get the truck!


00:19:22.728 --> 00:19:23.968
Quick. .. get the truck!


00:19:24.396 --> 00:19:25.431
Go home.


00:19:25.497 --> 00:19:27.238
What the fuck do you think...? Jack!


00:19:27.599 --> 00:19:28.976
You're out of your depth, John.


00:19:29.134 --> 00:19:31.011
Jack! What are you doing?


00:19:34.439 --> 00:19:36.419
No! No!


00:19:36.575 --> 00:19:37.815
We need him alive!


00:19:38.143 --> 00:19:39.281
Jack!


00:19:41.046 --> 00:19:42.286
You're gonna shoot me?


00:19:43.982 --> 00:19:45.984
You're gonna shoot your own father?


00:19:47.386 --> 00:19:49.127
You shouldn't be here, John.


00:19:50.455 --> 00:19:51.593
You shouldn't be here.


00:19:51.757 --> 00:19:53.737
What are you doing?


00:20:00.065 --> 00:20:01.066
Jack!


00:20:03.068 --> 00:20:04.069
Whoa!


00:20:04.469 --> 00:20:06.415
You're gonna fucking run over me?


00:20:06.572 --> 00:20:08.518
You're only making it worse!


00:20:08.574 --> 00:20:09.575
Jack.


00:20:21.553 --> 00:20:22.998
Get out of the way!


00:20:25.991 --> 00:20:27.129
Call a cop!


00:20:32.397 --> 00:20:35.207
Reaper One? Reaper One from 6-1-0.


00:20:36.635 --> 00:20:38.342
- Who's got him?
- Clock's running. Foxy.


00:20:38.503 --> 00:20:39.811
On the paper now. Box on.


00:20:39.972 --> 00:20:41.713
- Copy that. Box on.
- Okay, here we go.


00:20:41.873 --> 00:20:44.410
6-1, Reaper, we read you. Go ahead.


00:20:44.776 --> 00:20:45.846
Reaper, how are we looking?


00:20:45.978 --> 00:20:46.979
Your guy is late.


00:20:47.045 --> 00:20:48.888
His rate of progress is way off.


00:20:49.014 --> 00:20:50.584
MET now plus 6 minutes.


00:20:53.485 --> 00:20:55.829
MCC Reaper. MET now plus 6.


00:20:56.088 --> 00:20:57.226
This is un-frigging-believable.


00:20:57.356 --> 00:20:59.199
- MCC Reaper.
- That's not how it works.


00:20:59.358 --> 00:21:01.497
Something's off.
I know this guy. This doesn't happen.


00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:04.334
MCC Reaper, 6-1 is in the hole. Stand by.


00:21:04.529 --> 00:21:06.406
6-1, be advised, your window is closed.


00:21:06.565 --> 00:21:07.737
Time on target is no-go.


00:21:07.899 --> 00:21:09.845
I say again, TOT is no-go.


00:21:10.002 --> 00:21:13.575
Reaper, this is real-world,
not exercise, do you copy?


00:21:14.006 --> 00:21:16.509
No, sir, Moscow police will
have shut down the Garden Ring.


00:21:16.842 --> 00:21:18.617
- Reaper!
- He's no-go for extraction.


00:21:19.278 --> 00:21:21.280
- It's too late. Shut it down.
- Pull it!


00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:23.257
6-1, mission window is
closed. Reaper is out of here.


00:21:24.683 --> 00:21:25.684
Come on!


00:21:25.851 --> 00:21:27.023
Shit!


00:21:28.353 --> 00:21:29.354
Get me Operations.


00:21:29.521 --> 00:21:30.625
Reaper!


00:21:30.889 --> 00:21:32.197
Get Mike Collins looped in.


00:21:32.291 --> 00:21:36.296
Tell him it's Plan B, safehouse. Go now!
Plan B. No choice.


00:21:36.595 --> 00:21:37.699
Shit.


00:21:37.863 --> 00:21:40.343
It's blown. They shut the Garden Ring.


00:21:43.368 --> 00:21:45.041
Harvest is in effect. Keep on working.


00:21:45.103 --> 00:21:46.241
Let's finish this, Foxy.


00:21:47.406 --> 00:21:49.647
Damn you, McClane!


00:21:50.242 --> 00:21:51.277
Damn you!


00:22:19.805 --> 00:22:20.806
Oh, fuck!


00:22:21.139 --> 00:22:23.449
Jack! I'm not done talking to you!


00:22:27.612 --> 00:22:28.750
Who is this?


00:22:28.814 --> 00:22:29.986
Come on, go!


00:22:48.433 --> 00:22:49.810
Concentrate, please.


00:23:10.122 --> 00:23:11.499
That's right,
come on through, yeah!


00:23:11.656 --> 00:23:12.794
See if you can hit this guy!


00:23:28.373 --> 00:23:29.374
Jesus!


00:23:56.601 --> 00:23:57.944
I'm tired of this guy.


00:23:58.170 --> 00:24:00.047
RPG now!


00:24:04.176 --> 00:24:05.177
Jesus!


00:24:26.898 --> 00:24:29.970
You missed! Interesting choice, man.


00:24:44.749 --> 00:24:47.161
Hey, hey!


00:24:47.319 --> 00:24:48.320
Hey!


00:24:48.720 --> 00:24:49.755
Whoa!


00:24:50.422 --> 00:24:51.457
Hey! Whoa!


00:24:58.430 --> 00:24:59.431
Come on!


00:24:59.498 --> 00:25:01.273
You gotta be fucking kidding me!


00:25:04.903 --> 00:25:05.938
What?


00:25:09.508 --> 00:25:12.284
Do you think I understand
a word you're saying?


00:25:15.780 --> 00:25:17.259
Jesus Christ.


00:25:17.415 --> 00:25:20.294
It's okay, I'm fine, thanks.


00:25:28.927 --> 00:25:31.271
Oh, man, you're driving like my grandma!


00:25:31.363 --> 00:25:33.934
When I say drive, I mean fly!


00:25:44.175 --> 00:25:45.984
Oh, yeah!


00:26:08.099 --> 00:26:09.510
Get out of the way!


00:26:10.402 --> 00:26:11.608
Oh, God.


00:26:17.509 --> 00:26:18.510
Jesus!


00:26:30.789 --> 00:26:32.996
- Oh, for the love of...


00:26:33.058 --> 00:26:34.469
- Hi, honey.
- Dad? Can you hear me?


00:26:34.526 --> 00:26:36.403
- How is Moscow?
- Can I call you back?


00:26:36.528 --> 00:26:37.529
Wait, don't...


00:26:43.068 --> 00:26:44.103
Sorry, ma'am!


00:26:49.240 --> 00:26:50.241
Sorry!


00:27:33.118 --> 00:27:35.189
Did you see this guy?


00:27:37.989 --> 00:27:39.263
Dad, can you hear me?


00:27:39.424 --> 00:27:40.926
Dad, are you still there?


00:27:41.292 --> 00:27:42.293
Dad?


00:27:48.133 --> 00:27:49.168
Oh, man!


00:27:49.701 --> 00:27:50.702
Knock knock.


00:27:54.773 --> 00:27:55.808
You still there?


00:27:55.974 --> 00:27:57.112
Yeah, I'm here.


00:27:58.176 --> 00:28:00.349
So, how is Jack?Have you seen him?


00:28:00.512 --> 00:28:02.514
Uh, yep, looking right at him.


00:28:02.681 --> 00:28:04.160
Is he okay?


00:28:04.315 --> 00:28:07.125
I haven't really caught up with him yet,
but he looks good.


00:28:08.386 --> 00:28:09.865
I'm gonna have to call you back.


00:28:10.021 --> 00:28:11.500
What's going on there?


00:28:11.656 --> 00:28:12.760
Luce, can I call you right back?


00:28:12.891 --> 00:28:13.995
Don't hang up...


00:28:18.730 --> 00:28:19.731
Guess who!


00:28:33.945 --> 00:28:35.424
I've had enough of this shit.


00:28:39.017 --> 00:28:41.054
Oh, man, hey!


00:28:42.253 --> 00:28:44.426
Is that it? Is that your best shot?


00:29:15.787 --> 00:29:17.630
Damn you, John.


00:29:19.057 --> 00:29:20.331
Damn you!


00:29:56.094 --> 00:29:57.471
Hey! Up here!


00:29:58.830 --> 00:30:00.776
Shoot up here!


00:30:05.336 --> 00:30:07.009
John! Get in!


00:30:08.306 --> 00:30:10.377
Get in before I change my mind. Jesus!


00:30:11.876 --> 00:30:13.685
Take your time.


00:30:19.484 --> 00:30:21.054
Jack, what the fuck was that, huh?


00:30:21.219 --> 00:30:23.324
Shut up. Shut up, John.


00:30:23.488 --> 00:30:25.399
I swear to God,
I will put a bullet in you this time.


00:30:25.557 --> 00:30:27.059
Who do you think you're talking to?


00:30:27.225 --> 00:30:28.636
The last person I want to see.


00:30:29.027 --> 00:30:30.370
Well, maybe you missed
the whole part back there


00:30:30.528 --> 00:30:32.439
where I saved you and Papa Geppetto here


00:30:32.564 --> 00:30:34.475
from a whole bunch of Russian bad guys.


00:30:34.632 --> 00:30:36.634
You saved? You saved?


00:30:36.801 --> 00:30:38.178
That's right, saved.


00:30:39.337 --> 00:30:40.816
- Shut up.
- Shut up.


00:30:41.005 --> 00:30:42.575
You're a world class screw-up,
you know that, John?


00:30:42.740 --> 00:30:45.220
I'm a screw-up? I'm a screw-up?


00:30:45.376 --> 00:30:46.377
I'm still your father.


00:30:46.477 --> 00:30:48.081
Yeah, nothing I can do about that.


00:30:48.546 --> 00:30:49.684
What a joke.


00:30:49.848 --> 00:30:51.350
Just shut up.
Try not to touch anything, all right?


00:30:51.516 --> 00:30:53.154
You've done enough goddamn damage.


00:30:55.486 --> 00:30:57.693
The appointment is next week...


00:30:57.922 --> 00:30:59.367
We will begin immediately.


00:30:59.424 --> 00:31:01.370
Excuse me, sir. Komarov has escaped.


00:31:02.327 --> 00:31:04.364
I'll call you back. There is a problem with Komarov.


00:31:04.429 --> 00:31:05.339
What happened?


00:31:05.763 --> 00:31:07.242
Some sort of attack on the courthouse.


00:31:07.599 --> 00:31:08.703
Who took him?


00:31:08.766 --> 00:31:09.767
They don't know yet.


00:31:10.235 --> 00:31:11.612
What do you mean you don't know?


00:31:12.036 --> 00:31:12.446
Eh...


00:31:12.871 --> 00:31:14.350
...well it's confusing...


00:31:14.839 --> 00:31:17.376
Eyewitnesses say they saw Komarov...


00:31:18.610 --> 00:31:20.089
...with an American.


00:31:21.579 --> 00:31:23.559
What American?


00:31:26.451 --> 00:31:28.522
John McClane.


00:31:30.855 --> 00:31:32.061
Let's go.


00:31:35.193 --> 00:31:36.433
After you.


00:31:37.562 --> 00:31:39.974
Yeah, I got him. Okay, I'm on it.


00:31:40.131 --> 00:31:42.475
Look, Mike,
we had an unexpected delay. I'm sorry.


00:31:42.533 --> 00:31:43.568
I understand.


00:31:43.635 --> 00:31:45.876
This is the last guy on earth
I expected to see.


00:31:46.037 --> 00:31:48.313
Listen to me, Yuri,
you have half of Moscow looking for you.


00:31:48.473 --> 00:31:50.214
- I need you to get dressed.
- Why am I here?


00:31:50.375 --> 00:31:53.083
Please put on these clothes. Trust me.


00:31:53.244 --> 00:31:55.383
This is the key to your cuffs. Take these.


00:31:55.546 --> 00:31:56.786
Oh, my Jesus.


00:31:56.948 --> 00:31:58.427
- Are you okay?
- What?


00:31:58.583 --> 00:32:00.995
Do you have the file on Chagarin?


00:32:02.720 --> 00:32:04.461
This is what you been doing, Jack?


00:32:05.223 --> 00:32:06.293
Spy shit?


00:32:08.726 --> 00:32:10.171
This is it?


00:32:10.328 --> 00:32:13.309
You're a spy? Oh, my God.


00:32:15.667 --> 00:32:18.841
The 007 of PIainfield, New Jersey.


00:32:19.470 --> 00:32:20.676
Very nice.


00:32:20.838 --> 00:32:22.909
McClane, shut up.


00:32:23.274 --> 00:32:24.776
Take it easy, Oddjob.


00:32:24.943 --> 00:32:26.786
I'm on vacation.


00:32:26.945 --> 00:32:28.288
Your mom will be pleased.


00:32:28.446 --> 00:32:30.255
We thought you were
doing drugs or something.


00:32:30.415 --> 00:32:31.450
Mr. Komarov.


00:32:31.582 --> 00:32:34.153
Or selling drugs, but that was me, really.


00:32:34.852 --> 00:32:37.526
Do you have the file on Chagarin?


00:32:37.956 --> 00:32:39.663
Yes, or no?


00:32:41.592 --> 00:32:42.935
It's very simple, Yuri.


00:32:43.027 --> 00:32:45.303
You give me the file,
and I get you out of Russia.


00:32:45.997 --> 00:32:48.876
And you're a free man. What do you say?


00:32:51.602 --> 00:32:55.015
It's not about me. I don't care about my life.


00:32:56.641 --> 00:32:57.711
Well, that's the deal.


00:32:57.875 --> 00:32:59.183
It's the only deal.


00:33:00.178 --> 00:33:02.180
Come on.


00:33:03.181 --> 00:33:05.889
Come on, Yuri. Help yourself.


00:33:06.718 --> 00:33:08.129
What's it gonna be?


00:33:09.854 --> 00:33:11.993
Yes or no?


00:33:12.156 --> 00:33:14.966
The clock is ticking, Yuri. Come on.


00:33:16.127 --> 00:33:18.004
You will get me out of here?


00:33:18.162 --> 00:33:19.232
Only the three of you?


00:33:19.397 --> 00:33:21.638
Whoa, Nijinsky. I'm not in the gang.


00:33:21.799 --> 00:33:24.075
I just got off the plane. I'm still jet-lagged.


00:33:24.235 --> 00:33:27.148
I'm not involved in this. Huh, Jack?


00:33:29.874 --> 00:33:32.354
Only if I can take my daughter with me.


00:33:35.813 --> 00:33:37.918
Chagarin's people will kill her.


00:33:40.251 --> 00:33:42.390
Fine. Make it quick.


00:33:43.588 --> 00:33:44.623
Ah.


00:33:44.689 --> 00:33:46.066
Where's the file?


00:33:47.091 --> 00:33:50.004
It's in a vault in Prypiat,
but the key is here in Moscow.


00:33:50.161 --> 00:33:51.265
At Hotel Ukraina.


00:33:54.899 --> 00:33:58.745
Make your call.
We're going to the Ukraina, let's go.


00:34:06.844 --> 00:34:07.618
It's papa...


00:34:09.747 --> 00:34:10.919
I'm fine, Sunshine...


00:34:11.749 --> 00:34:12.557
...we'll talk later.


00:34:13.284 --> 00:34:13.785
Listen.


00:34:14.919 --> 00:34:17.195
I'll be waiting for you
where your mother and I shared our first dance.


00:34:17.622 --> 00:34:18.430
Now.


00:34:20.425 --> 00:34:21.904
Hurry! Hurry! You understand?


00:34:32.203 --> 00:34:35.047
Mike, listen, I'm sorry
about this morning, man.


00:34:36.574 --> 00:34:38.747
It's fine.


00:34:39.777 --> 00:34:42.257
Okay, let's go.


00:34:46.751 --> 00:34:47.752
Contact!


00:34:50.788 --> 00:34:52.358
Down! Get down!


00:34:52.590 --> 00:34:54.194
Go! Get down! Go, go, go!


00:34:57.695 --> 00:34:58.969
John, cover!


00:35:14.712 --> 00:35:15.713
Come on, buddy!


00:35:18.149 --> 00:35:20.129
Go! Go!


00:35:26.757 --> 00:35:28.464
That's right,jerk-off!


00:35:28.559 --> 00:35:29.731
All right, let's move, John!


00:35:29.894 --> 00:35:31.271
I'm on fucking vacation!


00:35:31.429 --> 00:35:33.306
Come on, time to hustle. Watch your head.


00:35:35.333 --> 00:35:36.334
McClane, move it.


00:35:36.501 --> 00:35:38.412
8,000 fucking miles for this?


00:35:43.474 --> 00:35:45.249
Get down, Yuri. Stay low!


00:35:45.476 --> 00:35:46.614
Head down.


00:35:46.744 --> 00:35:48.485
Come on. Go, go!


00:36:02.460 --> 00:36:03.837
Safe house, my ass.


00:36:09.734 --> 00:36:10.735
He knows how old we are, no?


00:36:10.801 --> 00:36:11.802
Come on.


00:36:17.008 --> 00:36:18.009
Here, here, here.


00:36:18.242 --> 00:36:20.347
Sit down. You're all right.


00:36:20.511 --> 00:36:21.751
Let me look at you.


00:36:22.346 --> 00:36:23.689
-- It's all right. You're fine.


00:36:23.848 --> 00:36:25.293
What are you doing?


00:36:26.751 --> 00:36:27.786
Jack.


00:36:27.852 --> 00:36:29.695
Calm down, Yuri, okay?
You're gonna be just fine.


00:36:29.854 --> 00:36:32.664
Here, put this on, stay warm.


00:36:34.625 --> 00:36:37.265
What was that, John?
Five minutes? Five minutes?


00:36:37.428 --> 00:36:39.169
You blew a three-year op in five minutes!


00:36:39.330 --> 00:36:40.604
You're welcome!
What do you want me to do?


00:36:43.000 --> 00:36:44.001
Unbelievable.


00:36:44.135 --> 00:36:45.205
Unbelievable.


00:36:45.369 --> 00:36:48.475
I'm so fucking burned.
I got no friends in this town anymore.


00:36:48.639 --> 00:36:51.449
What about your people at Langley?
Just give them a call.


00:36:51.609 --> 00:36:53.885
Give me your phone.


00:37:01.619 --> 00:37:03.826
It's a two-year contract on that phone.


00:37:03.988 --> 00:37:06.127
What are you carrying? Give me that.


00:37:08.125 --> 00:37:09.763
All right. You got any cash on you?


00:37:10.861 --> 00:37:12.431
Some American money.


00:37:12.597 --> 00:37:15.043
What are you talking about?
We need to keep on moving.


00:37:15.499 --> 00:37:18.844
We have to get this guy to a doctor.
To medical attention, Jack.


00:37:19.003 --> 00:37:20.004
The mission stands.


00:37:20.204 --> 00:37:22.548
Your mission is bleeding out over there.


00:37:22.707 --> 00:37:24.846
The mission continues. We go to the hotel.


00:37:28.646 --> 00:37:32.219
Come on, let's move. Let's move.


00:37:43.861 --> 00:37:44.999
This is nuts.


00:37:45.296 --> 00:37:46.900
What, are you going to go out
and kill somebody else now?


00:37:47.064 --> 00:37:48.805
Why all this trouble for just one guy?


00:37:49.033 --> 00:37:50.740
He's a political prisoner.


00:37:51.302 --> 00:37:52.406
Not that you care, John,


00:37:52.570 --> 00:37:54.880
but it's a matter
of national security, all right?


00:37:55.039 --> 00:37:58.486
He's got the goods to stop Viktor
Chagarin, and we need that to happen.


00:37:58.643 --> 00:37:59.713
Well, great, Jack.


00:37:59.877 --> 00:38:01.754
Let's drop him off at the Embassy,
and we can go home.


00:38:01.912 --> 00:38:04.415
Are you kidding me?
After what happened at the safe house?


00:38:05.750 --> 00:38:07.093
Look, it doesn't work like that, all right?


00:38:07.251 --> 00:38:09.253
It's a huge diplomatic mess,
and I'm a burnable asset.


00:38:09.420 --> 00:38:12.230
So, I now need that file
to un-fuck this mission.


00:38:12.423 --> 00:38:13.493
Any more questions?


00:38:13.658 --> 00:38:15.103
Yeah,just one.


00:38:15.259 --> 00:38:17.364
How come you never called
and told me where you were?


00:38:18.062 --> 00:38:19.564
Like you'd give a shit.


00:38:31.075 --> 00:38:33.077
All right, hold up, hold up.


00:38:36.881 --> 00:38:40.158
Okay, Yuri, listen to me, all right?
We're almost done.


00:38:40.718 --> 00:38:42.857
As soon as we get that key,
we're gonna grab the file,


00:38:43.054 --> 00:38:45.056
get you and your daughter
out of Russia, all right?


00:38:45.222 --> 00:38:46.530
All right.


00:38:47.825 --> 00:38:51.705
Listen to me, you're doing good. All right?


00:38:51.862 --> 00:38:54.103
I need you to hang here a second.
Keep an eye on him, John.


00:38:54.265 --> 00:38:55.403
Hey, hey.


00:38:55.566 --> 00:38:59.207
What is it with all this "John" shit?
Whatever happened to "Dad?"


00:38:59.837 --> 00:39:01.544
Good question.


00:39:04.675 --> 00:39:07.417
In Russia, we have word for men like him.


00:39:08.179 --> 00:39:09.681
'Krutoi. "


00:39:10.614 --> 00:39:13.788
It means "tough," "hard."


00:39:13.951 --> 00:39:17.296
In America, it means "juvenile delinquent."


00:39:19.357 --> 00:39:21.462
Is he your only child?


00:39:23.060 --> 00:39:25.904
No. I got a daughter, too.


00:39:26.731 --> 00:39:28.938
You?


00:39:31.802 --> 00:39:34.646
I have only my Solnyschka.


00:39:35.373 --> 00:39:38.820
When she was little,
I was working all the time.


00:39:39.710 --> 00:39:42.748
I believed work was all that mattered.


00:39:48.152 --> 00:39:50.655
I screwed my kid's life up, too.


00:39:50.921 --> 00:39:51.922
You work all the time


00:39:51.989 --> 00:39:54.902
around the clock most of the time,
when you're a cop.


00:39:55.326 --> 00:40:00.776
I just thought that working all the
time was a good thing, you know?


00:40:06.737 --> 00:40:08.273
I didn't help him at all.


00:40:11.342 --> 00:40:13.288
It's never too late,


00:40:14.612 --> 00:40:15.784
I hope.


00:40:18.749 --> 00:40:20.592
Okay, let's go.


00:40:30.294 --> 00:40:32.672
All right, Yuri, which part of
the building is the ballroom in?


00:40:32.763 --> 00:40:33.764
Main tower.


00:40:33.931 --> 00:40:35.501
Main tower. Which floor?


00:40:35.599 --> 00:40:36.634
Top floor.


00:40:36.700 --> 00:40:38.304
Top floor.


00:40:38.402 --> 00:40:39.437
What about security?


00:40:39.503 --> 00:40:41.346
You remember any guards?
Cameras? Anything like that?


00:40:41.505 --> 00:40:43.382
I don't know.


00:40:43.541 --> 00:40:45.043
Well, I need you to remember.


00:40:45.209 --> 00:40:47.211
I was in prison for five years,
how should I know?


00:40:47.478 --> 00:40:49.185
- Everything could have changed.
- I know.


00:40:49.346 --> 00:40:52.020
Just think, all right? Picture it in your head.


00:40:52.850 --> 00:40:54.830
The ballroom was closed in '89.


00:40:54.952 --> 00:40:56.954
I think it's under construction now.


00:40:57.288 --> 00:40:58.733
So that floor's unsecured.


00:40:58.889 --> 00:41:01.199
I don't know! Listen!
My daughter is in there.


00:41:01.258 --> 00:41:02.532
I'm scared to death, let's go!


00:41:02.593 --> 00:41:04.129
-- Just calm down, Yuri.


00:41:29.720 --> 00:41:31.757
I guess you have done that before.


00:41:34.391 --> 00:41:35.734
Smart.


00:41:38.562 --> 00:41:40.599
I could have done it.


00:42:23.374 --> 00:42:25.547
Irina?


00:42:26.410 --> 00:42:28.583
Irina?


00:42:34.385 --> 00:42:36.490
Irina?


00:42:41.492 --> 00:42:42.630
Papa.


00:42:46.564 --> 00:42:48.100
- Irina.
- Papa!


00:42:50.968 --> 00:42:52.970
That's tender.


00:42:53.604 --> 00:42:55.515
Really? I wouldn't know.


00:43:05.983 --> 00:43:07.462
Need a hug?


00:43:10.087 --> 00:43:12.363
We're not really a hugging family.


00:43:12.523 --> 00:43:14.093
That's right.


00:43:15.859 --> 00:43:17.338
We just have to get one thing...


00:43:18.195 --> 00:43:20.106
...and then we're leaving Moscow for good.


00:43:20.931 --> 00:43:21.466
OKAY?


00:43:21.932 --> 00:43:22.342
OKAY.


00:43:30.374 --> 00:43:31.318
Who are they?


00:43:34.545 --> 00:43:36.354
The young one works for CIA.


00:43:37.214 --> 00:43:39.956
The old one is his father. Americans.


00:43:41.785 --> 00:43:42.957
Then thank God for them.


00:43:45.155 --> 00:43:47.294
There's something no good about this.


00:43:47.458 --> 00:43:48.869
Just shut up, all right?


00:43:50.628 --> 00:43:51.732
I'm telling you, Jack,


00:43:52.630 --> 00:43:54.132
this smells bad.


00:43:56.166 --> 00:43:57.804
Just stop, okay?


00:43:58.168 --> 00:44:02.514
This might seem like a totally
foreign concept, you know?


00:44:02.673 --> 00:44:04.983
I know you love
to just run in, making shit up.


00:44:05.075 --> 00:44:06.748
But like any professional, I have a plan.


00:44:06.910 --> 00:44:08.719
So let's just stick to it, okay?


00:44:08.879 --> 00:44:10.483
Just move your plan along.


00:44:10.914 --> 00:44:12.757
All right, Yuri, come on.
Let's grab the key, get out of here.


00:44:12.816 --> 00:44:14.227
Yes.


00:44:14.918 --> 00:44:16.693
Just take a moment.


00:44:35.172 --> 00:44:36.173
How you doing?


00:44:38.776 --> 00:44:40.278
Fine.


00:44:50.220 --> 00:44:52.029
How did you get over here so quick?


00:44:55.392 --> 00:44:56.564
Well...


00:44:57.461 --> 00:45:00.271
I took Garden Ring.


00:45:00.531 --> 00:45:04.707
Oh, the Garden Ring.
Supposed to always be bad, right?


00:45:14.812 --> 00:45:15.950
Hey, John.


00:45:16.246 --> 00:45:17.384
Did you get stuck in traffic?


00:45:19.717 --> 00:45:21.993
I have it! I have it.


00:45:25.289 --> 00:45:27.235
Welcome, Americans.


00:45:33.764 --> 00:45:35.607
Put your goddamn guns down, asshole!


00:45:44.308 --> 00:45:46.288
Papa, what is going on?


00:45:49.847 --> 00:45:51.485
Give me your weapons.


00:45:52.282 --> 00:45:53.522
Come and get them.


00:45:59.923 --> 00:46:01.129
Really?


00:46:02.292 --> 00:46:03.464
Really.


00:46:06.196 --> 00:46:07.334
Papa.


00:46:09.867 --> 00:46:11.175
Yuri.


00:46:11.235 --> 00:46:12.509
Do it.


00:46:14.671 --> 00:46:16.480
I thought you were a problem child.


00:46:34.858 --> 00:46:37.498
This a part of your plan, Mr. Professional?


00:46:40.531 --> 00:46:41.669
What are you doing?


00:46:42.366 --> 00:46:43.845
It's about money, papa...


00:46:44.401 --> 00:46:45.903
...millions of dollars.


00:46:46.303 --> 00:46:47.577
You think life was easy for me?


00:46:47.671 --> 00:46:49.582
While you were sitting in prison being a victim?


00:46:50.741 --> 00:46:51.913
But,


00:46:52.075 --> 00:46:54.419
I'm your father.


00:46:56.413 --> 00:46:58.017
And I am your daughter.


00:46:59.249 --> 00:47:01.490
We should kill the old man now.


00:47:01.652 --> 00:47:02.995
We still need him.


00:47:03.387 --> 00:47:04.764
But them you can kill.


00:47:05.189 --> 00:47:06.725
Thank you.


00:47:09.993 --> 00:47:11.028
Hi.


00:47:12.763 --> 00:47:14.868
I don't know if l'm saying this right.


00:47:16.366 --> 00:47:17.367
Hi.


00:47:19.736 --> 00:47:23.411
Do you know what I hate
about the Americans?


00:47:24.708 --> 00:47:25.846
Everything.


00:47:27.277 --> 00:47:29.416
Especially cowboys.


00:47:48.599 --> 00:47:52.445
I could have been a dancer. I swear to God.


00:47:57.207 --> 00:47:59.653
But nobody supported me.


00:48:04.181 --> 00:48:05.182
You two


00:48:07.718 --> 00:48:10.221
have been such a


00:48:10.420 --> 00:48:13.492
pain in the ass!


00:48:31.375 --> 00:48:33.252
I prefer dancing, really.


00:48:33.977 --> 00:48:38.824
But killing is much, much better
than working in a grocery shop!


00:48:43.220 --> 00:48:44.255
Jesus Christ!


00:48:46.957 --> 00:48:47.958
Nice one.


00:49:01.305 --> 00:49:03.979
You guys. So arrogant.


00:49:04.474 --> 00:49:06.454
It's not 1986, you know.


00:49:08.645 --> 00:49:10.420
Reagan is dead.


00:49:17.988 --> 00:49:20.730
Sorry. Oh, God.


00:49:30.634 --> 00:49:32.011
What's funny there?


00:49:32.836 --> 00:49:33.837
Can't tell you.


00:49:34.771 --> 00:49:37.342
It's not you. I love these outfits.


00:49:38.508 --> 00:49:40.681
You guys are looking good.


00:49:48.919 --> 00:49:51.024
That was enough, thank you.


00:49:54.291 --> 00:49:55.326
Let's dance.


00:50:13.076 --> 00:50:14.077
Come on! Come on!


00:50:26.456 --> 00:50:27.526
Jack!


00:50:28.425 --> 00:50:31.167
Remember the last time we talked
just before you went away?


00:50:32.629 --> 00:50:34.302
Oh, no! No, no!


00:50:34.464 --> 00:50:36.944
You're not gonna open up to me
right before we die!


00:50:38.668 --> 00:50:40.341
No, that's not your thing, John.


00:50:40.504 --> 00:50:41.642
What's my thing?


00:50:41.805 --> 00:50:44.115
Fucking killing bad guys, that's your thing!


00:50:45.709 --> 00:50:47.450
You're not gonna die today!


00:51:14.838 --> 00:51:16.579
Go!


00:51:48.805 --> 00:51:50.045
Shit!


00:51:50.807 --> 00:51:51.808
Fuck.


00:51:53.043 --> 00:51:54.545
We're finished, John.


00:52:04.154 --> 00:52:05.690
I can't believe this.


00:52:12.596 --> 00:52:14.837
I can't believe this. This is unbelievable.


00:52:23.173 --> 00:52:25.449
Jack. Hey!


00:52:33.350 --> 00:52:34.351
Jesus!


00:52:38.088 --> 00:52:39.089
Come on!


00:52:46.963 --> 00:52:47.964
Let's get out of this building!


00:53:04.147 --> 00:53:04.784
Where are they?


00:53:09.219 --> 00:53:10.220
Come on.


00:53:35.045 --> 00:53:36.718
Alik, that's it. We're done!


00:53:36.780 --> 00:53:37.383
Let's go!


00:53:37.614 --> 00:53:38.285
Break left!


00:53:38.582 --> 00:53:39.322
Copy, Commander.


00:54:13.683 --> 00:54:14.593
Do you have him?


00:54:14.751 --> 00:54:16.196
Yes.


00:54:16.353 --> 00:54:17.161
And the file?


00:54:17.420 --> 00:54:19.024
Does he have it?


00:54:19.589 --> 00:54:21.830
I need that file, Alik.


00:54:21.992 --> 00:54:23.528
He's taking us to it.


00:54:24.961 --> 00:54:27.373
No more mistakes, Alik.


00:54:27.998 --> 00:54:29.671
And when you have the file...


00:54:30.433 --> 00:54:32.208
...kill them both.


00:54:33.770 --> 00:54:34.805
Yes, sir.


00:54:53.023 --> 00:54:54.127
Shit.


00:54:58.662 --> 00:55:01.006
That was exciting.


00:55:01.164 --> 00:55:03.667
Yeah. Loads of fun.


00:55:04.868 --> 00:55:06.848
You wanna go again?


00:55:10.006 --> 00:55:11.144
Are you shot?


00:55:11.308 --> 00:55:12.309
No.


00:55:12.809 --> 00:55:14.015
No, I'm fine.


00:55:14.844 --> 00:55:16.380
Let me take a look at that.


00:55:16.546 --> 00:55:18.321
It's fine.


00:55:19.215 --> 00:55:20.660
Oh, fuck.


00:55:20.817 --> 00:55:24.094
I can't believe she betrayed
her father for Chagarin.


00:55:25.522 --> 00:55:27.695
I don't understand that.


00:55:29.559 --> 00:55:31.698
Someday you will.


00:55:32.529 --> 00:55:33.940
Kids.


00:55:37.367 --> 00:55:39.574
What's our next move?


00:55:40.236 --> 00:55:42.341
I don't know.


00:55:42.772 --> 00:55:44.683
- You don't know?
- I don't know, all right?


00:55:44.908 --> 00:55:46.945
I mean, I'm out of moves. I don't know.


00:55:47.410 --> 00:55:48.889
I don't know.


00:55:50.347 --> 00:55:51.883
I screwed up.


00:55:52.782 --> 00:55:54.352
I blew the mission.


00:56:01.925 --> 00:56:04.064
Well, then we're done, right?


00:56:04.227 --> 00:56:05.228
Yeah, we're done.


00:56:05.295 --> 00:56:06.638
We're done.


00:56:06.796 --> 00:56:09.037
We should just go home.


00:56:09.199 --> 00:56:11.805
We'll stop by a little pharmacy
on our way out of Moscow,


00:56:11.968 --> 00:56:15.575
get you some Merthiolate or mercury


00:56:15.739 --> 00:56:17.275
and fix up your little scratches, here.


00:56:17.640 --> 00:56:20.553
Get you home. Get a little toy set.


00:56:21.044 --> 00:56:24.491
Get yourself a nice warm glass of milk
with a little Bosco in it.


00:56:24.647 --> 00:56:26.251
Get your CIA slippers.


00:56:26.416 --> 00:56:27.554
All right.


00:56:27.717 --> 00:56:29.390
- What?
- I get it.


00:56:30.320 --> 00:56:32.425
What the hell are we gonna do?


00:56:33.289 --> 00:56:35.394
What's in the file?


00:56:35.592 --> 00:56:38.129
Evidence on Chagarin.


00:56:41.931 --> 00:56:43.467
Evidence about what?


00:56:44.267 --> 00:56:46.611
Chernobyl.


00:56:49.239 --> 00:56:50.843
Look, listen to me.


00:56:51.007 --> 00:56:53.009
Komarov and Chagarin used to have this


00:56:53.176 --> 00:56:57.625
nasty little side-racket going on
back in the day.


00:56:59.649 --> 00:57:02.823
They siphoned weapons-grade uranium,
got greedy,


00:57:03.420 --> 00:57:05.866
caused the meltdown.


00:57:07.424 --> 00:57:10.598
Then, you know, they fell out.


00:57:10.827 --> 00:57:13.467
Former partners, bad break-up.


00:57:14.931 --> 00:57:16.672
Scumbags.


00:57:17.767 --> 00:57:19.542
So, Chagarin had Komarov thrown in jail.


00:57:19.702 --> 00:57:22.376
You know, put him in a hole,
forget about him.


00:57:22.539 --> 00:57:24.485
Doesn't have to worry anymore.


00:57:25.975 --> 00:57:28.182
So what happened to rescuesque?


00:57:28.812 --> 00:57:30.985
Well, he grew a conscience.


00:57:32.849 --> 00:57:35.455
Yeah, well, that figures.


00:57:35.618 --> 00:57:39.862
Listen, Chagarin is bad news.
He's the real deal.


00:57:40.023 --> 00:57:43.732
If we see this guy in control,
we're gonna see the whole thing fall apart.


00:57:43.893 --> 00:57:47.067
I'm talking terrorism,


00:57:47.230 --> 00:57:49.073
WMDs,


00:57:49.699 --> 00:57:51.076
nukes.


00:57:54.904 --> 00:57:57.384
Someone has to stop him.


00:57:58.641 --> 00:58:01.554
Well, that's what we do.


00:58:03.346 --> 00:58:07.920
We go out to Chiapep and we do our thing.


00:58:09.586 --> 00:58:11.156
Our thing?


00:58:11.254 --> 00:58:12.255
Yeah.


00:58:13.590 --> 00:58:16.070
We go out there and kill a lot of scumbags.


00:58:22.665 --> 00:58:25.111
What? You got something better to do?


00:58:25.268 --> 00:58:28.249
All right. Pull it.


00:58:28.771 --> 00:58:30.478
You're not gonna cry, are you?


00:58:30.640 --> 00:58:32.483
Just pull it.


00:58:32.642 --> 00:58:34.713
Everybody needs a good cry
once in a while, Jack.


00:58:35.211 --> 00:58:36.918
- Don't be ashamed.
- Pull it.


00:58:37.146 --> 00:58:38.716
You remember that time when


00:58:38.882 --> 00:58:42.989
you and Ralphie Mauser
were gonna have that house-painting job?


00:58:43.152 --> 00:58:44.495
Got your finger caught in the ladder,


00:58:44.621 --> 00:58:45.998
you cried for about five, six days.


00:58:46.155 --> 00:58:47.463
John,just pull it!


00:58:47.891 --> 00:58:50.064
All right.


00:58:50.226 --> 00:58:52.172
On three. Here you go.


00:58:52.495 --> 00:58:54.406
One, two...


00:58:59.402 --> 00:59:00.574
Good God.


00:59:00.737 --> 00:59:02.307
Jesus.


00:59:04.140 --> 00:59:06.177
When was the last time
you had a tetanus shot?


00:59:11.781 --> 00:59:13.260
You all right?


00:59:13.416 --> 00:59:14.520
Yeah.


00:59:15.952 --> 00:59:17.454
We need a car.


00:59:18.121 --> 00:59:19.623
Atta boy.


00:59:19.789 --> 00:59:21.234
Back to work.


00:59:40.944 --> 00:59:43.720
Hey, Watergate, how's that lock coming?


00:59:43.880 --> 00:59:45.484
Almost there.


00:59:45.648 --> 00:59:47.457
Here, try these.


00:59:48.685 --> 00:59:49.857
Come on.


00:59:50.019 --> 00:59:52.465
Oh, stealing. That's nice. Real nice, John.


00:59:52.722 --> 00:59:55.259
Yeah, I'm up for
the Father of the Year award.


00:59:57.493 --> 00:59:58.528
Whoa.


01:00:01.064 --> 01:00:02.543
All right.


01:00:02.732 --> 01:00:04.712
How'd you know all of these guns
were gonna be here?


01:00:04.867 --> 01:00:06.869
It's a Chechen hangout.


01:00:07.036 --> 01:00:08.811
Owner doesn't like guns in the club,


01:00:08.938 --> 01:00:10.747
so these bozos leave them in their cars.


01:00:11.174 --> 01:00:13.017
You learn a lot in three years.


01:00:13.076 --> 01:00:14.077
Yeah.


01:00:20.083 --> 01:00:22.359
Are we really
going to Chernobyl?


01:00:22.919 --> 01:00:24.421
Yeah.


01:00:25.521 --> 01:00:26.864
The Chernobyl.


01:00:27.857 --> 01:00:29.200
The radioactive joint? Meltdown?


01:00:29.359 --> 01:00:31.066
That's the one.


01:00:32.695 --> 01:00:34.697
It's not the Chernobyl in Switzerland, right?


01:00:34.864 --> 01:00:38.038
With all the skiing and
the snow and everything?


01:00:38.201 --> 01:00:40.238
You mean Grenoble?


01:00:41.571 --> 01:00:44.609
No, sorry, we're not going to Grenoble.


01:00:51.547 --> 01:00:54.050
Eddie Collins's kid
took him on vacation last year.


01:00:54.217 --> 01:00:55.594
They went down to Boca.


01:00:55.752 --> 01:00:56.753
Oh, yeah?


01:00:56.886 --> 01:00:57.887
Spent four days at the track.


01:00:58.121 --> 01:00:59.794
Well, that's nice.


01:01:00.156 --> 01:01:01.829
That's relaxing.


01:01:01.991 --> 01:01:04.494
Oh, yeah. Sure.


01:01:05.828 --> 01:01:07.899
We have to go to Chernobyl?


01:01:08.064 --> 01:01:09.907
Yeah, sorry about that.


01:01:10.433 --> 01:01:13.312
But all the radioactive stuff is out, right?


01:01:49.338 --> 01:01:51.181
Is it as you remember, papa?


01:01:51.808 --> 01:01:52.980
I don't want to remember.


01:01:55.078 --> 01:01:55.920
Tough.


01:01:58.514 --> 01:01:59.254
The file...


01:01:59.982 --> 01:02:01.154
...is in the inner vault.


01:02:03.886 --> 01:02:06.526
Very touching. Let's move.


01:02:30.947 --> 01:02:32.449
Which one is it?


01:02:33.116 --> 01:02:35.392
Get moving, old goat.


01:02:53.069 --> 01:02:56.607
Couple of fresh coats of paint
and a weedwacker and it's good to go.


01:03:04.781 --> 01:03:07.591
You know, at first,
they denied anything even happened.


01:03:07.750 --> 01:03:10.356
Held a children's parade the next day
to prove it.


01:03:10.853 --> 01:03:14.926
24 hours later,
50,000 residents were evacuated.


01:03:15.825 --> 01:03:17.771
Never came back.


01:03:19.495 --> 01:03:22.669
As soon as they get in that vault,
Komarov's a dead man.


01:03:25.301 --> 01:03:26.837
All right.


01:04:11.047 --> 01:04:12.890
You got a plan?


01:04:14.016 --> 01:04:15.188
Not really.


01:04:16.385 --> 01:04:18.490
I kind of thought we'd just wing it.


01:04:18.688 --> 01:04:23.228
You know, run in, guns blazing,
making shit up as we go.


01:04:24.327 --> 01:04:25.601
- Yeah?
- Yeah.


01:04:29.599 --> 01:04:31.078
What is this? A pirate gun?


01:04:31.234 --> 01:04:33.737
Yeah. It's old school, man.


01:04:34.036 --> 01:04:35.037
Like you, right?


01:04:35.438 --> 01:04:37.076
Yeah, like me.


01:04:40.042 --> 01:04:42.852
One of these days,
I'm gonna have a long talk with you.


01:04:59.595 --> 01:05:01.131
Look, Jack,


01:05:02.231 --> 01:05:04.370
I'm sorry your partner got killed.


01:05:06.402 --> 01:05:10.373
I'm sorry I fucked up your day.
That wasn't my plan.


01:05:11.741 --> 01:05:13.743
I caused you problems.


01:05:13.910 --> 01:05:17.289
You know, I came here for something else.


01:05:21.050 --> 01:05:24.054
And all that other bullshit. I mean,


01:05:27.823 --> 01:05:29.632
I had a pretty good day.


01:05:32.061 --> 01:05:34.974
It's fun, running around with you.


01:05:40.903 --> 01:05:42.576
It's good to see you.


01:05:48.678 --> 01:05:51.090
I love you, boy.


01:05:56.819 --> 01:05:58.264
You, too.


01:06:00.523 --> 01:06:02.696
I want you to know I got your back.


01:06:06.362 --> 01:06:08.364
I got yours, too.


01:06:12.768 --> 01:06:16.147
All right. Let's go kill some motherfuckers.


01:06:37.960 --> 01:06:38.461
Key.


01:08:02.244 --> 01:08:04.952
Okay, what the fuck is this?


01:08:05.448 --> 01:08:08.861
I'm losing my patience.
The fucking file better be here.


01:08:13.489 --> 01:08:16.095
Radiation has been
pooling in this room for decades.


01:08:18.961 --> 01:08:21.168
You've underestimated us,
Daddy dearest.


01:08:21.764 --> 01:08:23.641
Bring it in!


01:09:07.309 --> 01:09:08.845
Atta boy.


01:09:14.517 --> 01:09:15.325
Come on! Come on!


01:09:16.185 --> 01:09:21.430
Compound 27-4.
It neutralizes radiation, trust me.


01:09:35.070 --> 01:09:37.710
What's this remind you of?


01:09:39.408 --> 01:09:40.409
Newark.


01:09:59.695 --> 01:10:03.438
All clear. We can ditch the suits.


01:10:27.756 --> 01:10:30.600
The hell is that?


01:10:32.328 --> 01:10:35.969
One billion euros worth
of enriched uranium.


01:10:37.499 --> 01:10:39.001
What?


01:10:40.236 --> 01:10:43.308
Don't worry, it's stable in this form.


01:10:43.372 --> 01:10:44.407
File!


01:10:46.408 --> 01:10:50.254
Irina, cut the crap, please.


01:10:50.679 --> 01:10:54.126
No one here is speaking about uranium.
Where's the file?


01:10:55.317 --> 01:10:57.661
No more games, where is the file?


01:11:03.259 --> 01:11:05.967
That's no longer your concern.


01:11:30.986 --> 01:11:31.828
Sunshine...


01:11:32.688 --> 01:11:33.723
...you did well.


01:11:37.626 --> 01:11:38.832
I told you...


01:11:39.628 --> 01:11:40.732
...everything would work out.


01:11:43.899 --> 01:11:44.809
Come to papa.


01:11:58.580 --> 01:11:59.684
Pap, you're a genius.


01:12:01.250 --> 01:12:01.853
I know.


01:12:07.156 --> 01:12:07.827
Load it up.


01:12:11.193 --> 01:12:11.694
Pegasus?


01:12:12.728 --> 01:12:13.502
Do you copy?


01:13:02.378 --> 01:13:04.756
A lot of hardware for a file.


01:13:14.056 --> 01:13:15.296
Wheels up in five minutes.


01:13:16.258 --> 01:13:16.895
Perfect.


01:13:58.267 --> 01:13:59.268
Here you go, sir.


01:13:59.601 --> 01:14:01.603
Team extraction completed. She's all yours.


01:14:02.104 --> 01:14:02.582
Good.


01:14:33.135 --> 01:14:34.478
Are you inside?


01:14:35.070 --> 01:14:35.946
Yes, yes, Viktor.


01:14:38.340 --> 01:14:39.580
I'm inside.


01:14:42.478 --> 01:14:43.513
Yuri?


01:14:45.080 --> 01:14:45.922
You surprised?


01:14:48.250 --> 01:14:50.696
I'm in the same place where it all started...


01:14:51.620 --> 01:14:53.190
...before you betrayed me.


01:14:54.122 --> 01:14:54.862
Remember...


01:14:56.825 --> 01:14:59.328
...you promised to give me my life back.


01:15:00.596 --> 01:15:01.836
You gave it back to me.


01:15:03.632 --> 01:15:04.542
I thank you for that.


01:15:07.002 --> 01:15:08.276
And now...


01:15:09.004 --> 01:15:10.347
...I'm going to take yours.


01:15:40.536 --> 01:15:42.106
Static 4, we are ready for take off.


01:15:44.339 --> 01:15:46.683
Static 4, do you copy?


01:15:51.813 --> 01:15:53.292
Yuri!


01:15:56.952 --> 01:15:58.397
Yuri.


01:15:58.554 --> 01:16:00.727
Where's the dancer?


01:16:01.189 --> 01:16:03.533
You okay? You hurt?


01:16:03.692 --> 01:16:05.194
No.


01:16:08.063 --> 01:16:09.064
I'm good.


01:16:12.834 --> 01:16:14.370
I'm all right.


01:16:19.074 --> 01:16:21.486
What's in these boxes?


01:16:24.580 --> 01:16:26.491
Thank God you're here, Jack.


01:16:27.683 --> 01:16:29.026
We have to leave.


01:16:29.318 --> 01:16:30.695
They're coming back any minute.


01:16:33.422 --> 01:16:35.925
Just let me get the file.


01:16:36.224 --> 01:16:37.760
What's in the boxes?


01:16:41.263 --> 01:16:43.504
It's U-235.


01:16:45.367 --> 01:16:47.608
Weapons-grade uranium.


01:16:49.571 --> 01:16:51.573
Armored cases.


01:16:57.245 --> 01:16:58.622
The bomb kind?


01:17:00.382 --> 01:17:02.726
Yeah, the bomb kind.


01:17:08.557 --> 01:17:10.036
Not so fast, Eddie.


01:17:10.225 --> 01:17:11.397
Are you crazy?


01:17:12.427 --> 01:17:13.929
Yeah, a little bit.


01:17:14.096 --> 01:17:15.404
I'm getting the file.


01:17:16.732 --> 01:17:19.576
No. No, you're not.


01:17:20.435 --> 01:17:23.541
The key. It's your vault, isn't it, Yuri?


01:17:23.705 --> 01:17:26.777
What? No. No, I...


01:17:27.109 --> 01:17:28.884
You put this shit in here, right?


01:17:29.044 --> 01:17:30.045
What? No.


01:17:30.178 --> 01:17:31.179
Right?


01:17:31.680 --> 01:17:33.591
I didn't know, Jack.


01:17:42.524 --> 01:17:44.197
Is that the dancer down there?


01:17:44.559 --> 01:17:45.970
What are you talking about?


01:17:46.261 --> 01:17:48.036
That's a tough break for a good athlete.


01:17:48.697 --> 01:17:51.234
Jack, you know me.


01:17:53.368 --> 01:17:56.212
Yeah, I know you. I know you.


01:17:57.873 --> 01:17:59.546
I know him better.


01:18:02.077 --> 01:18:05.957
Never was a file, was there, Yuri?


01:18:15.624 --> 01:18:17.103
Of course there was no file.


01:18:17.659 --> 01:18:19.639
It was simply bait.


01:18:20.462 --> 01:18:23.238
What I needed was in this vault.


01:18:23.398 --> 01:18:25.036
Chagarin was the only one with enough


01:18:25.100 --> 01:18:27.239
power and influence to get me out of jail.


01:18:28.170 --> 01:18:30.582
I used him.


01:18:32.307 --> 01:18:34.082
I used you.


01:18:36.578 --> 01:18:38.683
It's about money.


01:18:38.980 --> 01:18:40.584
When's it not about money?


01:18:40.749 --> 01:18:42.023
You want to arrest me?


01:18:44.286 --> 01:18:48.757
You're out of your jurisdiction,
Detective McClane, aren't you?


01:18:48.957 --> 01:18:51.494
I wouldn't worry too much
about being arrested.


01:18:52.627 --> 01:18:54.470
See, my boy


01:18:55.197 --> 01:18:57.177
is in the CIA.


01:18:57.466 --> 01:18:59.605
No phone call.


01:19:00.535 --> 01:19:01.843
Spy shit.


01:19:02.504 --> 01:19:06.611
Goddamn Americans.
You think you're so smart.


01:19:07.309 --> 01:19:10.950
No, I'm not that smart. I'm just on vacation.


01:19:11.113 --> 01:19:12.786
My boy here,


01:19:14.316 --> 01:19:15.795
he gonna put a whooping on you.


01:19:21.323 --> 01:19:22.597
Move!


01:19:29.898 --> 01:19:33.846
You can say goodbye to your daughter,
you dumbwit fuck.


01:19:39.374 --> 01:19:41.479
Where's your little Soltschanitsa?


01:19:54.890 --> 01:19:56.563
- Shit!
- God damn it!


01:20:01.563 --> 01:20:02.564
Shit!


01:20:26.288 --> 01:20:27.164
Irina, I'm going to the roof...


01:20:27.823 --> 01:20:28.426
The roof!


01:20:31.626 --> 01:20:32.900
Jack!


01:20:51.279 --> 01:20:52.155
Set at 91.


01:20:52.414 --> 01:20:53.188
Power plant?


01:20:53.515 --> 01:20:54.357
All good to go.


01:20:54.449 --> 01:20:54.984
Let's go!


01:21:23.011 --> 01:21:24.012
Subtle.


01:21:24.679 --> 01:21:26.784
What the hell is in
those goddamn grenades?


01:21:33.955 --> 01:21:34.956
Go get him!


01:21:35.557 --> 01:21:37.730
I'm going to the helicopter!


01:22:32.280 --> 01:22:34.021
Vadim, watch the tail.


01:22:34.182 --> 01:22:36.219
Copy. You are at 120 meters...


01:22:37.285 --> 01:22:38.059
...115 meters...


01:23:05.313 --> 01:23:06.553
There is small arms fire coming from the roof.


01:23:21.429 --> 01:23:21.964
We have a guest.


01:23:22.998 --> 01:23:24.944
Watch the tail for me there.


01:23:33.074 --> 01:23:33.575
Come on!


01:23:34.075 --> 01:23:34.985
Come on, hurry!


01:23:35.677 --> 01:23:37.588
Vadim, give me firing control now...


01:23:38.480 --> 01:23:39.083
Engaging!


01:23:45.353 --> 01:23:46.354
Jack!


01:23:49.491 --> 01:23:50.026
Shoot him!


01:23:50.492 --> 01:23:51.436
With pleasure, papa.


01:23:58.299 --> 01:24:00.210
I'm on fucking vacation!


01:24:03.104 --> 01:24:04.344
Vadim! He is there! I see him!


01:24:11.980 --> 01:24:14.051
The shit we do for our kids.


01:24:14.449 --> 01:24:16.224
Yippee ki-yay, motherfucker.


01:24:20.855 --> 01:24:21.799
What happened?


01:24:30.799 --> 01:24:32.142
CG's shifted...


01:24:33.034 --> 01:24:34.411
I've got full forward cyclic.


01:25:05.400 --> 01:25:06.902
I can't hold it.


01:25:09.804 --> 01:25:10.839
Jesus Christ!


01:25:16.578 --> 01:25:17.579
Well done,


01:25:18.213 --> 01:25:19.783
Mr. Super-spy.


01:25:22.650 --> 01:25:26.393
What a shame your father
won't be alive to see you promoted.


01:25:27.555 --> 01:25:29.296
Neither will you.


01:25:44.139 --> 01:25:46.517
Hey! Jack!


01:25:48.743 --> 01:25:50.620
Hang on, John!


01:26:28.283 --> 01:26:29.489
John!


01:26:35.190 --> 01:26:36.567
Come on!


01:26:45.233 --> 01:26:46.576
We're out of ammunition!


01:26:47.135 --> 01:26:48.011
Shit.


01:26:49.003 --> 01:26:49.879
Bastards.


01:26:50.371 --> 01:26:52.146
What the hell are you doing?


01:26:55.009 --> 01:26:55.851
This is for you, papa.


01:27:59.907 --> 01:28:00.908
John!


01:28:03.711 --> 01:28:04.712
John!


01:28:06.247 --> 01:28:07.248
John!


01:28:14.889 --> 01:28:15.890
John!


01:28:20.795 --> 01:28:21.967
Dad!


01:28:24.332 --> 01:28:25.333
Right here.


01:28:52.660 --> 01:28:54.298
Did you just call me Dad?


01:28:55.963 --> 01:28:57.101
No.


01:28:58.633 --> 01:29:00.112
I didn't think so.


01:29:01.936 --> 01:29:03.438
You're hearing things.


01:29:04.505 --> 01:29:07.076
You got swimmer's ear.


01:29:16.150 --> 01:29:19.154
We're not gonna grow any third arms
or anything, are we?


01:29:19.320 --> 01:29:20.492
No.


01:29:20.955 --> 01:29:22.696
You might lose your hair.


01:29:23.324 --> 01:29:24.462
Laugh it up, kid.


01:29:25.093 --> 01:29:27.630
This is you, five years from now.


01:29:28.096 --> 01:29:30.098
It's rainwater. You'll be fine.


01:29:30.264 --> 01:29:33.438
Besides, it's hard to kill a McClane.


01:29:34.969 --> 01:29:36.846
Now you're a McClane?


01:29:37.004 --> 01:29:40.315
Yeah, I'm a McClane. John McClane.


01:29:40.475 --> 01:29:41.954
John McClane Junior.


01:29:42.977 --> 01:29:45.423
Well, that makes you a "senior."


01:29:45.580 --> 01:29:47.082
That's right.


01:29:47.248 --> 01:29:48.818
Try not to forget it.


01:29:48.983 --> 01:29:50.621
I'm your father.


01:29:52.019 --> 01:29:54.829
Have some respect for your father.


01:29:55.790 --> 01:29:56.996
Let me ask you something.


01:29:59.026 --> 01:30:00.437
Do you go looking for trouble


01:30:00.495 --> 01:30:03.442
or does it always just seem to find you?


01:30:05.533 --> 01:30:08.514
You know, after all these years,


01:30:09.370 --> 01:30:12.112
I still ask myself the same question.


01:32:02.683 --> 01:32:04.822
l had a dream last night
That l was piloting a plane


01:32:04.886 --> 01:32:07.992
And all the passengers
were drunk and insane


01:32:08.055 --> 01:32:11.366
l crash landed in a Louisiana swamp


01:32:11.425 --> 01:32:14.963
Shot up a horde of zombies
But l come out on top


01:32:15.029 --> 01:32:17.168
What's it all about?


01:32:17.231 --> 01:32:20.508
Guess it just reflects my mood


01:32:22.537 --> 01:32:26.212
Sitting in the dirt
Feeling kind of hurt


01:32:26.274 --> 01:32:31.781
All l hear is doom and gloom


01:32:33.180 --> 01:32:37.458
And all is darkness


01:32:37.518 --> 01:32:39.657
ln my room


01:32:40.788 --> 01:32:46.295
Through the light, your face l see


01:32:47.762 --> 01:32:52.802
Baby, take a chance
Baby, won't you dance with me


01:32:55.403 --> 01:32:58.646
Lost all that treasure in an overseas war


01:32:58.706 --> 01:33:02.552
It just goes to show you don't get
what you paid for


01:33:02.610 --> 01:33:05.989
Battle to the rich
and you worry about the poor


01:33:06.047 --> 01:33:09.961
Put my feet up on the couch
And lock all the doors


01:33:10.017 --> 01:33:11.394
What's that funky noise?


01:33:11.452 --> 01:33:15.161
It's the tightening of the screws


01:33:17.191 --> 01:33:21.003
Sitting in the dirt
Feeling kind of hurt


01:33:21.062 --> 01:33:26.444
All I hear is doom and gloom


01:33:28.102 --> 01:33:30.981
But when those drums


01:33:31.038 --> 01:33:33.917
Go boom, boom, boom


01:33:35.109 --> 01:33:38.318
Through the night


01:33:38.379 --> 01:33:41.883
Your face l see


01:33:42.383 --> 01:33:48.231
Baby, take a chance
Baby, won't you dance with me


01:33:50.625 --> 01:33:51.626
Yeah!


01:33:51.726 --> 01:33:56.072
Baby, won't you dance with me


01:33:56.130 --> 01:33:57.871
Ah, yeah


01:34:18.486 --> 01:34:22.730
Fracking deep for oil
But there's nothing in the sump


01:34:22.790 --> 01:34:26.431
There's kids all picking at the garbage dump


01:34:26.494 --> 01:34:29.839
lam running out of water
so l better prime the pump


01:34:29.897 --> 01:34:34.039
lam trying to stay sober but l end up drunk


01:34:34.101 --> 01:34:38.880
We'll be eating dirt
Living on the side of the road


01:34:41.208 --> 01:34:43.085
There's some food for thought


01:34:43.144 --> 01:34:46.853
Kind of makes your head explode


01:34:48.616 --> 01:34:50.289
Feeling kind of hurt


01:34:51.018 --> 01:34:52.224
Yeah!


01:34:52.286 --> 01:34:55.267
But all l hear


01:34:55.322 --> 01:34:58.132
Is doom and gloom


01:34:59.260 --> 01:35:03.675
And all is darkness


01:35:03.731 --> 01:35:06.075
In my room


01:35:06.667 --> 01:35:09.773
Through the night


01:35:09.837 --> 01:35:13.046
Your face I see


01:35:14.341 --> 01:35:16.582
Baby, take a chance


01:35:17.111 --> 01:35:20.285
Won't you dance with me


01:35:20.915 --> 01:35:22.189
Yeah!


01:35:22.616 --> 01:35:23.617
Come on!


01:35:23.951 --> 01:35:26.693
Baby, won't you dance with me


01:35:28.589 --> 01:35:30.694
I'm feeling kind of hurt


01:35:30.758 --> 01:35:33.762
Baby, won't you dance with me


01:35:34.528 --> 01:35:36.269
Oh, yeah!


01:35:36.330 --> 01:35:38.037
Sitting in the dirt


01:35:38.099 --> 01:35:42.138
Baby, won't you dance with me
